Nethack is a game in which people -expect- to die.  Roguelikes are all
about dying!  That's why there's a high score list, the idea is to try
to overcome insurmountable obstacles through wit, skill and luck.  Not
work through a quest where victory is a foregone conclusion before you
even begin -- like practically every other RPG on the planet.

