although they are generally aimed at a game with its excesses curbed.
I offered the YANI as something to suggest and ask people to think
about.  Talking about changing Nethack shouldn't be a referendum on
fixing it; people like Nethack because there's lots of cool stuff as
well as trying to win.  Yeah, the way the game is structured at the
moment, some of the items are less useful than #1 and #2 on the Boots
chart, but maybe that means the game should be changed around them,
instead of the other way around.

